[ed. p. 5]

guhyasiddhiḥ

śrīpadmavajrapādaviracitā

prathamaḥ pacricchedaḥ

oṃ prajñopā[yā]ya namaḥ

(namo) vajratīkṣṇāya namaḥ

lokācārair vimuktaṃ paramaśivapadaṃ vyāpinaṃ niḥsvabhāvaṃ |
nityotpannaṃ ya[tīndrair] munivaravṛṣabhair vanditaṃ dhyānahīnam  || 1.1 ||
buddhānām apy agamyaṃ paramuṣitamalaṃ tattva[ta]s taṃ praṇamya |
śrīmatkāyaṃ jinānāṃ kim api padavaraṃ śuddham apy ātmavṛttyā
% śrīmatkāyaṃ] em. ed.; śrīmaṅkāyaṃ MS
	
vakṣye śrīguhyasiddhiṃ paramasuracitāṃ śreyasīṃ ratnabhūtā
buddhatvāṇyā(vā)ptiheto[ḥ] parapadagamanānveṣaṇeṣv agradūtīm |
nānācāryānubaddhāṃ kalimalamathanīṃ vighnavikṣepakṛtyāṃ |
siddhīnāṃ janmabhūmīd(-bhumiṃ) guṇaśatanilayāṃ mātṛbhūtāṃ jinānām || 1.2 ||
% -sucaritāṃ] em. ed.; sucaritaṃ MS
% śreyasīṃ] em. ed; śreyasī MS
% ratnabhūtāṃ] em. ed.; ratnabhūtā MS
	
	aparyantaguṇādhāraṃ trivajrābheda(trivajrābhedya-)vigraham |
	mahāsukhaṃ praṇamyādau vākkathātītagocarāt(vākpathātītagocaram) || 3 ||
	
	vakṣyate padmavajreṇa guhyasiddhir anuttarā |
	sādhakānāṃ hitārthāya karuṇāviṣṭacetasā || 4 ||
	
	yenoktā bhūtanāthenānekatantrāntarair api |
	āptopadeśasaṃyuktā sā mayā kathayate 'dhunā || 5 ||

[ed. p. 6]

	utpannakramayogena tyaktā(tyaktvā) sarvaprayatnataḥ |
	utpattivistaraṃ dūramādikarmikabhāvanām || 6 ||
	
	tantrasadbhāvam āśritya siddhisaṃdeha(-saṃdoha-)lakṣaṇam |
	vihāya vistaraṃ sarvaṃ bhāvanāyāntarāyikam || 7 ||
	
	saṃkṣepād vakṣyate divyā buddhasiddhipradā śubhā |
	prajñopāyavidhānena guhyasiddhir anuttarā || 8 ||
	
	śubhodayā nirāyāsā sarvavighnanikartanī |
	nidhānaṃ sarvasidhīnāṃ cintāmaṇir ivāparā || 9 ||
	
	jananī sarvabuddhānāṃ vikṣepāripramardanī |
	sarvārthasādhanī caiva abhisambodhilakṣaṇā || 10 ||
	
	sidhyanti sādhakā yasyā yatra tatra vyavasthitā[ḥ] |
	divyopāyasamāyuktā bhāvanāsu pratiṣṭhitā[ḥ] || 11 ||
	
	prāpunvanti parāṃ bodhiṃ trivajrābhedarūpiṇīm |
	pracchannavratarūpeṇa dharmasyāpi virodhikāḥ(virodhakāḥ) || 12 ||
	
	vrajanty anuttaraṃ sthānaṃ kālāvadhivivarjitāam(-vivarjitam) |
	prāṇātipātinaḥ krūrāḥ krūrakarmaratāś ca ye || 13 ||
	
	mithyāvāgvādajālena mohayitvāpi ye narāḥ |
	narā jīvanti te 'py āśu yatra sidhyanti caryayā || 14 ||
	
	paradārābhigantāraḥ paracittāpahāriṇaḥ(paravittāpahāriḥaḥ) |
	jugupsāhīnakarmāṇi kurvanto 'pi nirantaram || 15 ||
	
	yāṃ caritvā vrajanty ānu(āśu) kāmadhātūrddhataḥ(-ūrdhvataḥ) param |
	pracchannavratarūpeṇa sādhakānāṃ bravīmy aham || 16 ||
	
	guhyacaryāṃ parāṃ divyāṃ sopāyāṃ sarvasiddhidām |
	prāpyate janmanīhaiva vajrasattvapadaṃ yayā || 17 ||

[ed. p. 7]

	icchanti ye paraṃ śāntaṃ buddhānāṃ śāśvataṃ padam |
	samprāṣṇuteranuṣṭheyā(samprāptuṃ tair anuṣṭheyā) guhyasiddhiḥ parā śubhā || 18 ||
	
	vibhāvya tattvasaṃyuktair utpannakramayogataḥ |
	anyathā tttvahīnais tu naiva siddhir avāpyate || 19 ||
	
	tattvaṃ hi kalpanābāhyaṃ sarvopadhivivarjitam |
	nirnimittaṃ nirābhāsaṃ nirdvandvaṃ paramaṃ śivam || 20 ||
	
	yāvad vikalpyate yuktyā śāstrāgamavidhikriyā |
	tāvad vistarakāṃ(vistaratāṃ) yāti tailabindur ivāmbhasi || 21 ||
	
	tad alaṃ tāvat tena vikalpayo 'nantarakāriṇā(vikalpāntarakāriṇā) |
	śāstreṇa tattvaniṣṭhasyā(-niṣṭhasya) utpattikramarūpiṇāḥ(-rūpiṇaḥ) || 22 ||
	
	prathamaṃ tattvena vijñāya tattvasiddhe[r] vidhānakam |
	tataḥ saṃvṛtim utpādya bhāvanādiṣu tattvataḥ || 23 ||
	
	paścāt caryāṃ prakurvīta tattvoddīpitamānasaḥ |
	tadantaraṃ(anantaraṃ) tu vai kāryaṃ vrataṃ vidyāsamanvitam || 24 ||
	
	anyathā tattvahīnasya kiṃ vratena prayojanam |
	jīvikāheturūpeṇa narakāvāptikāriṇā || 25 ||
	
	vrataṃ vināpi sidhyanti sādhakās tattvatatparāḥ |
	tattvahīnā na sidhyanti cīrṇāvrataśatair(cīrṇair vrataśatair) api || 26 ||
	
	sidhyanti tattvasaṃyuktāḥ sarvatraiva hi nirmalāḥ |
	sādhakā bhāvanāśaktyā nirmuktāḥ sarvakalmaṣaiḥ || 27 ||
	
	tac ca tattvaṃ sthitaṃ tantre śrīsamāje parisphuṭam |
	guptam anyatra nirdiṣṭaṃ prapañcākavistaraiḥ(prapañcānekavistaraiḥ) || 28 ||
	
[ed. p. 10]

	kriyācaryādibhedena sūtrāntapiṭakādibhiḥ |
	ekam eva paraṃ śuddhaṃ naikākāraṃ vyavasthitam || 29 ||
	
	sthāpitaṃ buddhanāthena tattvaṃ saṃgopya yatnataḥ |
	sattvāśayānubhedena skandharatnakaraṇḍake || 30 ||
	
	tad viditvā prayatnena svadehe saṃvyavasthitam |
	bodhicittaṃ paraṃ śuddhaṃ gurupādaprasādataḥ || 31 ||
	
	tataś caryāṃ prakurvīta bhāvanāṃ vā gṛhe sthitaḥ |
	tattvaratnaviśuddhātmā sarvadvandvavivarjitaḥ || 32 ||
	
	anyathā ye prakurvanti divyopāyavivarjitāḥ |
	viruddhasamayādīni pacyante te tu raurave || 33 ||
	
	yathā vahnau pradīpte 'smin tṛṇādaisaṃcayaḥ(tṛṇadārvādisaṃcayaḥ) |
	prakṣipto bhasmatāṃ yāti prarohaṃ na punar vrajet || 34 ||
	
	yatha(tathā) tattvavihīnās kurvanto 'tyadbhūtāni tu |
	vipannā narakaṃ yānti yāvad ākāśasaṃbhavet(-saṃbhavaḥ) || 35 ||
	
	duṣprāpyaṃ tatpadaṃ divyaṃ tattvam ity abhiśabditam |
	prāpyate yena tacchuddhaṃ tadupāyaṃ bravīmy aham || 36 ||
	
	paśyanti ye hy anānātvaṃ guror vajradhrasya ca |
	prāpnuvanty atra te tattvaṃ siddhisaṃdeha(-saṃdoha-)lakṣaṇam || 37 ||
	
	ye punar māninaḥ krūrāḥ śaṭhā dhūrtā[ḥ] prapañcakāḥ(pravañcakāḥ) |
	rāgādyāsaktacittāś ca kuto labdhaṃ kuto na tu || 38 ||
	
	śāṭhyena tu guruṃ natvā cchidrānveṣaṇatatparam(-tatparāḥ) |
	mithyābhimānino duṣṭā vāgvādeṣu sadā ratā || 39 ||

[ed. p. 9]

	vajrabhrātṛgurūṇāṃ ca vañcanābaddhacetasaḥ |
	prāpnuvanti na te sattvās tatparaṃ siddhidaṃ param || 40 ||
	
	anye 'pi cātra dṛśyante paryūpāsya gurūn dṛḍham |
	praṇāmapūjāsatkārair yāvat prāptaṃ samīhitam || 41 ||
	
	prāpte tu tatpade divye purato 'pi vyavasthitam |
	na jānanti durātmānaḥ ko 'yaṃ kasmād ihāgataḥ || 42 ||
	
	dṛṣṭvā 'py ekākinaṃ dūre praṇāmaṃ kurvate dṛḍham |
	bahūnāṃ tu punar madhye svāgate 'pi daridratā || 43 ||
	
	evaṃvidhās tu ye sattvāḥ prāpnuvanti na te padam |
	paraṃ paramanirvāṇaṃ yad uktaṃ bhūtavādinā || 44 ||
	
	anye 'pi cāpare sattvā dṛśyante gurunindakā |
	tyaktalajjā durācārāḥ saṃbhūtaguṇadūṣakāḥ || 45 ||
	
	tantrasaṃgrahamātreṇa tattvabhāvabahirmukhāḥ |
	nābhiṣiktā na tu jñātāḥ kurvante(kurvate) śiṣyasaṃgraham || 46 ||
	
	svayaṃ gṛhītamātrāś ca pustaka. vīkṣya harṣitāḥ |
	ācāryaṃ naiva jānanti samayācāravarjitāḥ || 47 ||
	
	anugrahaṃ ca sattvānāṃ kurvante(kurvate) pustakājñayā |
	na ca tattvaṃ vijānanti yad uktaṃ bhūtavādinā || 48 ||
	
	eteṣāṃ caiva teṣāṃ ca sarveṣāṃ pāpakarmaṇām |
	asanmārgapravṛttānāṃ gatir ekaiva nārakī || 49 ||
	
[ed. p. 10]

	ebhir durāsādaiḥ sārdhaṃ samayācāravarjitaiḥ |
	vāso 'pi naiva kartavyaḥ saugatīṃ siddhim icchatā || 50 ||
	
	paryupāsya ciraṃ kālaṃ kāyavākcittato dṛḍham |
	ācārya sarvabhāvena yāvat tuṣṭiṃ parāṃ gataḥ || 51 ||
	
	tataḥ prāpnoti nirvighnaṃ gurupādaprasādataḥ |
	śiṣyaḥ sunirmalaṃ tattvaṃ saṃpradāyavyavasthitam || 52 ||
	
	tena siddhir bhavaty āśu bhāvitena divāniśam |
	vipulā tattvarājena trivajrābhedarūpiṇī || 53 ||
	
	siddhiś ca sādhakendrāṇāṃ mantramudrādivistaraiḥ |
	naikatantrāntare 'tyuktā('py uktā) japahomavratādibhiḥ || 54 ||
	
	sandhyāvidhicatuṣkeṇa deśamaṇḍalalekhanaiḥ |
	varṇarūpādibhedena kulānāṃ ca vikalpanaiḥ || 55 ||
	
	snānārcanopavāsaiś ca mudrābandhakramais tathā |
	pratimādividhānaiś ca caityakarmapravistaraiḥ || 56 ||
	
	evaṃ vikalpalakṣais tu yā proktā bhūtavādinām |
	siddhis tayā 'pi sidhyanti kintu naivātra sādhakāḥ || 57 ||
	
	tad alaṃ kiṃ tayā tāvad bhūtayā 'py atra kāraṇam |
	siddhiḥ saukhyādhikair duḥkhaiḥ prāpyate yātiyātanaiḥ || 58 ||
	
	asmiṃs tu śrīsamājākhye tyaktvā sarvaṃ pravistaram |
	sidhyate janmanīhaiva utpannakramayogataḥ || 59 ||
	
	śrīsamājāt paraṃ nāasti ratnabhūtaṃ tridhātuke |
	sārāt sārataraṃ proktaṃ tantrāṇām uttarottaram ||  60 ||
	
[ed. p. 11]

	sthitam uddeśanirdeśair utpannakramayogataḥ |
	samājaṃ ye na jānanti susiddhau(susiddhir) ghaṭate katham || 61 ||
	
	sarvasaṃśayacchettāram ajñānatimirāpaham |
	śrīsamājaṃ parityajya buddharatnakaraṇḍakam || 62 ||
	
	ajño vāñcchati so 'nyatra siddhir(siddhīr)naikavikalpitāḥ |
	hanty asau muṣṭinākāśaṃ pibec ca mṛgatṛṣṇakām || 63 ||
	
	tantrasya vistaraṃ tyaktvā ādikarmikabhāvanam |
	prajñopāyaṃ viditvā tu yathā bhūtaṃ vyavasthitam || 64 ||
	
	tatas tu bhāvayed dhīmān ekacittaḥ suniścayāt |
	aharniśaṃ kṛtābhyāsaḥ sidhyate nātra saṃśayaḥ || 65 ||
	
	na tithir na nakṣatraṃ nopavāso vidhīyate |
	advayajñānayuktasya siddhir bhavati saugatī || 66 ||
	
	bhaktiṃ vajradhare sadā guṇanidhau kṛtvā tu vajrāmalāṃ |
	janmābdhāvatipāpavīcigahane potaikabhūtāṃ parām |
	paścāt sādhanam ārabheta matimān tantroktamārgānugaṃ |
	guhyaṃ sarvaguṇodayaṃ gatamalaṃ sarvārthasiddhipradam || 67 ||
	
iti paramārthasatyakṣaratantrasadbhāvoddhṛtāyāṃ śrīguhyasiddhi(-siddhau) vajrasattvasādhanavratatattvanirdeśo nāma prathamaḥ paricchedaḥ ||

[ed. p. 12]

dvitīyaḥ paricchedaḥ

	athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi sādhanaṃ guhyasaṃbhavam |
	kiñcit samājamārgeṇa nānyatantrakrameṇa tu || 1 ||
	
	bāhyatantrakriyāmārgaṃ sarvaṃ tyaktvā 'tidūrataḥ |
	sāmnāyakramayogena yathābhūtaṃ nigadyate || 2 ||
	
	ācāryā bahavaḥ prāhus tantre saṃgītikārakam |
	lokeśaṃ nāyakaṃ vīraṃ śrīsamāje mahādyutim || 3 ||
	
	vayaṃ tu kevalaṃ brūmo gurupādaprasādataḥ |
	abhāvaḥ śrīsamājasya anyasaṃgītikārakaḥ || 4 ||
	
	sraṣṭā tantrasya hṛdvajro vaktā sa eva deśakaḥ |
	abhāvas tāvad anyasya varjayitvā mahāsukham || 5 ||
	
	evaṃ śruteti yad vākyaṃ vijahārapade sthitam |
	tat svayaṃ sarvabuddheṣu kathitaṃ cittavajriṇā || 6 ||
	
	yathāvad bhāṣitaṃ divyaṃ vijahārapade sthitam |
	śrīmahāsukhanātena tathā kiñcid bravīmy aham || 7 ||
	
	ekasmin parame deśe yathā nirdiṣṭavān prabhuḥ |
	buddhānāṃ tantrasadbhāvaṃ svayam eva mahāsukham || 8 ||
	
	taṃ śrutvā tantrasadbhāvaṃ sarve caiva jinātmajāḥ |
	kampitās trāsam āpannās tam ūcuḥ parameśvaram || 9 ||
	
[ed. p. 13]

	kim iyaṃ dharmatā durbhāṣyā bhāṣitā prabho |
	atyantaṃ trāsajananī buddhānām api sarvathā || 10 ||
	
	atyantaguptam udghāṭya vajrayānam anuttaram |
	sarvadharmasamaikatvaṃ yat tvayā bhāṣitaṃ prabho || 11 ||
	
	evaṃ prajalpamānās te sarvabuddhamahaujasaḥ |
	prakampya mūrcchām āgamya bodhicitte mano dadhau(dadhuḥ) || 12 ||
	
	aho guptātiguptasya vajrayānasya deśanā |
	niḥsvabhāvasya śuddhasya vidyate yasya nopamā || 13 ||
	
	tān dṛṣṭvā vajrasattvas tu sarvabuddhān vimūrcchitān |
	divyaṃ smādhim āsthāya mahāsukhasukhātmakam || 14 ||
	
	niyujya ca tato buddhān vajrapadmaprayogataḥ |
	paramānandarūpeṇa provāca madhurāṃ giram || 15 ||
	
	dṛśyantāṃ he jināḥ srve bodhicittavijṛmbhitam |
	yatra kāyo na vāk cittaṃ tatra rūpaṃ pradṛśyate || 16 ||
	
	yāvad vikalpate(vikalpyate) yatnād bodhicittaprayogataḥ |
	dharmodayākṣaraṃ śāntaṃ sarvabuddhālayaṃ śivam || 17 ||
	
	tāvat prajñāsvarūpasya sarvam etad vikurvitam |
	niṣprapañcasya śuddhasya divyajñānasya sarvataḥ || 18 ||
	
	yat tatparaṃ śivaṃ śuddhaṃ sarvabuddhair namaskṛtam |
	avācyaṃ sarvagaṃ sthānam etac cittavikurvitam || 19 ||
	
	tad evaṃ saṃsthitaṃ divyaṃ khadhātvākhye nirāmayam |
	paramānandarūpeṇa sarvasattvasukhodayam || 20 ||

[ed. p. 14]

	prajñādehodbhavaṃ śuddhaṃ sarvabuddhālayaṃ śivam |
	tanmayā sevitaṃ buddhā divyadharmodayākṣaram || 21 ||
	
	ekārākṛti yad divyaṃ madhye vaṃkārabhūṣitam |
	ālayaṃ(ālayaḥ) sarvasaukhyānāṃ buddharatnakaraṇḍakam || 22 ||
	
	atas tat kathayiṣyāmi tantrādau yad vyavasthitam |
	evaṃ mahāsukhā vīrāḥ prāhuḥ sarvatathāgatān || 23 ||
	
	yā sā vai sarvabuddhānāṃ kāyavākcittayogataḥ |
	sthitā siddhipradā divyā nāmnā prajñeti viśrutā || 24 ||
	
	tasyāṃ vyavasthitaṃ yat tad bhagamm ity akṣradvayam |
	tanmayā śuddhatattvākhyaṃ sevitaṃ paramārthataḥ || 25 ||
	
	buddhaiś ca bodhisattvaiś ca sārdhaṃ trikāyavajribhiḥ |
	tatrāhaṃ saṃsthitaḥ śuddhe viharāmi yathecchayā || 26 ||
	
	nānyad dharmapadaṃ śuddhaṃ muktvā dharmodayākṣaram |
	yatra buddhāḥ samutpannā buddhabodhipratiṣṭhitāḥ || 27 ||
	
	ta[tra] trāsa(trāsaṃ) mā kurudhvaṃ śuddhe tattve nirālaye |
	dharmodayākṣare śānte vajrayoṣid vyavasthitāḥ(vyavasthitā) || 28 ||
	
	tat(tataḥ) sarvaṃ samutpannaṃ tiryagādy akhilaṃ jagat |
	tat kim arthaṃ jinā bhūyo yūyam uttrāsam āgatāḥ || 29 ||
	
	buddhānāṃ sārasaṃbhūtā iyaṃ sā dharmatā parā |
	sārajñānaikaniṣṭhānāṃ na bhūto na bhaviṣyati || 30 ||
	
	evaṃ ca tadvacaḥ śrutvā buddhabodhipratiṣṭhitāḥ |
	stuvantaḥ koṭiśaḥ sarve jātāḥ praṇatamūrtayaḥ || 31 ||
	
[ed. p. 15]

	uvāca(ūcaś ca) madhurāṃ vāṇīṃ sarvasattvahitauṣiṇīm |
	deśa(diśa) tattvaṃ jagannātha mahāvīra mahānune || 32 ||
	
	sarvabuddhāgrasaṃśuddha vajrayānapravartaka |
	nirvikāra nirābhāsa deśa(diśa) tattvaṃ nirālayam || 33 ||
	
	mahākleśārṇavāvīciṃ nistaranti yathā jināḥ |
	tadbhāṣa paramaṃ tattvaṃ sarvatattvottamottamam || 34 ||
	
	vijahārapadam ādau evaṃpadavibhūṣitam |
	yena vijñātamātreṇa siddhir bhavati saugatī || 35 ||
	
	evam adhyeṣaṇaṃ śrutvā śrīmahāsukhavajriṇaḥ |
	buddhānāṃ bodhisattvānāṃ bhāṣante param padam || 36 ||
	
	tadyathā sarvabuddhānāṃ kathitā cittavajriṇā |
	atyantguhyam udghāṭya vajrasārasamuccayam || 37 ||
	
	tadahaṃ kīrtayiṣyāmi yathābhūtaṃ vyavasthitam |
	jñātvā parisphuṭaṃ sarvaṃ gurupādaprasādataḥ || 38 ||
	
	atas tat kathyate divyaṃ sarvasiddhisamuccayam |
	sārāt sārataraṃ proktaṃ tantrādau yad vyavasthitam || 39 ||
	
	yan mahāsukhanāthena guhyatattvam udāhṛtam |
	buddhānāṃ bodhisattvānāṃ sarvasattvasukhodayam || 40 ||
	
	guhyakalpaikarājasya śrīsamājasya saṃsthitam |
	evam ity akṣaraṃ śuddhaṃ traidhātukanamaskṛtam || 41 ||
	
	yā sā śrībhūtanāthasya mudrā paramaśāśvatī |
	nāmnā prajñeti vikhyātā ādimadhyāntanirmalā || 42 ||
	
[ed. p. 16]

	sthitā saṃvṛtirūpeṇa trivajrajñānasaṃbhavā |
	karmamudrāti(karmamudreti) vikhyātā sattvānugrahahetunā || 43 ||
	
	mānuṣīṃ tanum āśritya sarvasattvahitaiṣiṇī |
	sarvatrā sarvagā śuddhā prajñādevī hy anuttarā || 44 ||
	
	sevitā sattvanāthena sādhu(sādhve) kasmin śubhodayā |
	khadhātubhuvane ramye viśvasthitikṛpālunā || 45 ||
	
	tasmād yad bhagam ity uktam evam ity akṣaradvayam |
	sthitaṃ tat sarvabuddhānāṃ kāyavākcittayogataḥ || 46 ||
	
atas tatsakalam apy uddeśanirdeśavyavasthitaṃ śrīmatsamājabhaṭṭārkāntarvatsyādhisthānā(-vartya api tadā-)mnāyaguhyātiguhyaparamārthādhyātikā(-adhyātmika-)tantrasadbhāvam adhikṛtyābhidhīyate ||
tadyathā

sthiracalasarvabhāvasvabhāvatathatājñānamāyānukārirūpeṇa cittavajriṇā dvātriṃśanmahāpuruṣalakṣaṇālaṅkṛtaśarīriṇā bhūtvā śrīsamāje 'cintya evam ityādiparamārthatattvaṃ buddhānāṃ bodhisattvānāṃ ca paramārtharūpeṇa vinirdiṣṭam |

tatparmārtham acintyadevatārūpaṃ yathā tantrakrameṇa saptadaśabodhisattvaparipāṭyā viniṣpannaṃ tat prakathyate |
prathamam upaodghātapaṭale saptadaśabodhisāttvābhidhānakīrtanāvasāne yathā dharmadhātusvabhāvavibhāvanāvajreṇa ca bodhisattvena mahāsattvena tad adhikṛyocyate |
ayaṃ tāvat prathamo devatāyogaḥ |
dharmadhātusvbhāvena niḥsvabhāvarūpiṇī(-rūpiṇā) kāyavākcittātmakena bhūtvā samayasamādhijāpavidhividhānena pūrveṇa pṛthivyādicaturmānuṣīkulena sahākāśadhātau vyavasthitā pañcakāmaguṇopabhogaṃ(-upabhoga-)dvāreṇānabhilāpyānabhilāpyā tiryagādyakhilasakalsattvakramādhiṣṭhitamantramūrtinā paramānandarūpeṇa paramasukhasvāaminā śrīpadmamaṇḍalādhiṣṭhitena (--jp.17) buddhānāṃ bodhisattvānāṃ ca paramārthadharmatā samayatattvāghoṣeṇa(-tattvodbhoṣeṇa) śravaṇena vimūrcchitānāṃ tadutthāpanahetor evam ityādi yat paramārthatattvaṃ nirdiṣṭaṃ tad ihocyate |

	atas tat kathyate guptaṃ tantrādau yad vyavasthitam |
	evam ity akṣaraṃ śuddhaṃ vajrayoṣidsamudbhavam || 47 ||
	
	evaṃ khadhātum ity uktaṃ samayamudreti viśrutā |
	śrutaṃ ca bhaṇyate hy asmin yat tasyāḥ sevanaṃ param || 48 ||
	
	nirvikalpakasarvajñajñānaṃ piṇdīkṛtaṃ tu yat |
