	ekasminn iti yat proktam uddeśaḥ so vidhīyayate('bhidhīyate) |
	tan mayā sevitaṃ tasmin khadhātvākhyaṃ sukhodadhim || 50 ||
	
	vicitraghaṇṭāsragdāmamaṇiratnopaśobhite |
	sarvabuddham aye divye sthāne paramapūjite || 51 ||
	
	bhagavān iti nirdiṣṭaś cittasyādhipatiḥ prabhuḥ |
	vajrayoṣit smṛtā prajñā yā sā sarvajinātmikā || 52 ||
	
	sarvaśabdena bhanyante akṣobhyāditathāgatāḥ |
	teṣāṃ ye kāyavākcittās tatra yeṣāṃ vyavasthitā || 53 ||
	
