	sarvabhāvasvabhāvena paramanandalīlayā || 54 ||
	
	ekārākṛti yad divyaṃ madhye vaṃkārabhūṣitam |
	tatparaṃ vajirṇaḥ sthānaṃ prajñādehodbhavaṃ śivam || 55 ||
	
